WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
But it’s useless if you agree alone

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,080
You have to get the four of them to agree too.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,040
Because what needs to be done may be dangerous

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,680
The five of you need to be together.

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:10,840
What are you four waiting for?

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,200
This is what you want

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,700
Let me agree

8
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:20,340
Fatty, you can be a medicine bucket for me.

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,420
Why do you want me to be your medicine bucket?

10
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,860
Then I don't agree

11
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,540
Just wait for death in this death row camp with me.

12
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:32,370
You, your medicine won't kill people, right?

13
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:36,810
In my whole life of practicing medicine, I have never killed anyone with medicine.

14
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,240
Shen San, you can trust him

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:46,760
It's true that he has never drugged anyone to death. It's true.

16
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:49,400
Okay, I believe you once

17
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,680
But we agreed that it can only be a one-time medicine.

18
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:55,250
I said this brother is a bit handsome

19
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:56,810
You should agree, right?

20
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:58,250
After all you are so young

21
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,730
If you die trapped in this death row camp

22
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:01,810
Isn't it a bit of a pity?

23
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:03,420
I promise

24
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:07,970
But you need to answer a few questions for me
